{"title":"The Evil God Descends, I Own Great Hell","synopsis":"Di tengah kiamat, dewa jahat turun, memakan manusia dan mengancam tanah airku, Cina! Sedikit yang mereka tahu, aku memegang kendali Neraka Penekan Iblis, di mana banyak dewa dan monster kuno dari Cina telah diam-diam dipenjara selama ribuan tahun! Semua untuk saat ini… untuk melenyapkan dewa asing dan membersihkan dunia manusia!\n\n— Tentu saja, jika kalian menyerah, sebagai Sipir, aku mungkin mempertimbangkan untuk membiarkan para dewa jahat bekerja di Neraka Besar dengan mesin jahit. dan tentu saja disediakan makan dan akomodasi.","alternative_title":"Evil God Descends, I Have a Great Calamitous Prison The Evil God Descends, I Own Great Hell 邪神降世，我有一座大凶狱","author":"米分文化","artist":"米分文化","genres":["Action","Drama","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"0120910d-b7ed-4e94-b4d1-f94a01dd4e4d","number":"128","title":"Chapter 128","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"c00c97ea-6a46-4e5a-a030-8088f1670667","number":"127","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"bdda8c33-d1c7-4d4f-9668-1ba8b4fc19f8","number":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"a84ebd63-c065-408b-a1c3-1a98f626c3d1","number":"125","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"14a992c4-d101-44e7-aee1-6ae10522188f","number":"124","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"4c935800-ee79-483b-b292-33db64d13bc8","number":"123","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"97225635-d2c8-46f7-a746-8ccf7fed94ba","number":"122","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"c6fa8530-46e7-49e9-8e95-fb17b3c10f81","number":"121","title":"Chapter 121","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"42c0e110-d6cc-4ac4-929d-7dd3f9a07eb1","number":"120","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"9bbdb087-7e1f-4b70-a247-72443dd1cbec","number":"119","title":"Chapter 119","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"a2310e23-7666-4945-9dfe-47146a11